#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:5
#: 3e2faf162e6c426bb9c6f11ab617c2da
msgid "Testing the Balance Bot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:7
#: fa302a07d44040b98e045abed4666da9
msgid "If you have completed all the previous steps successfully, then you're all set to start testing!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:12
#: 4473a2bfe45540e98474bb268fc369dc
msgid "For testing, make sure your vehicle is connected to the GCS via telemetry radio. USB would be too messy! Though we would suggest using mavproxy, Mission Planner works fine too."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:14
#: 8d0107c2447f4e76be0feb3c183302e4
msgid "Turn your vehicle on and connect to GCS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:16
#: 052506b025cc4d879938684700558b1b
msgid "Make sure your vehicle is standing nearly upright, then arm it from the GCS (It's better this way than from radio)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:18
#: eceef6ff65ec4ca3a422430a6a6ee191
msgid "If all is good, your vehicle should be able to balance itself or at least be trying to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:20
#: 21a8acda00e747b499cd5dfd265fe534
msgid "If the vehicle is trying to balance, but it's not perfect, try adjusting the PID values live(via GCS). If that isn't helping, turn the vehicle off. Go to the hardware page and see if you've met all the guidelines, especially regarding the wheels and weight distribution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:22
#: 388541dc22d94b5e87b2cae1051c1261
msgid "Once the vehicle can balance itself, try moving it around. Move up the throttle slightly and see how it goes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:24
#: 2ee423e3824c420e8138faffa325e7a9
msgid "If you find it too difficult to drive, try adjusting :ref:`BAL_PITCH_MAX<BAL_PITCH_MAX>`. It's the pitch angle at 100% throttle. If you increase it, the vehicle will accelerate faster but will become more likely to topple. Reducing it will make it more stable, but sluggish."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-testing.rst:28
#: f25abb470d89409c90df30e52f93ff87
msgid "It is possible to obtain better behavior of the rover by adjusting its PID. The :ref:`tuning page <balance_bot-tuning>` has more detailed information."
msgstr ""
